G.3  THE COMPARISON

  Instance 1   n = 10, m = 43, k = 3
                                                 RL    Enumeration
  ----------------------------------------------------------------
  growth of what is stored                   linear    exponential
  SYMBOLS HELD                                  140            150
    the boundaries (n + 1 + km)                 140              -
    addresses retained                            -        15 x 10
  ADDRESSES FORMED                               15          1,024
    of those, discarded                           0          1,009
  acts to assert the structure                  140              -
    envelope (n + 1)                             11              -
    boundaries (km)                             129              -
  opposites forced, charged 0                   139              -
  orientations forced by a boundary              34              -
  orientations the descent chose                 22              -
  boundary consultations                        395              -
  literal reads                                   -         14,152
  symbol writes                                   -         10,390
  satisfying assignments                         15             15
  ----------------------------------------------------------------
  symbols held: 140 against 150   (1.07 to 1)
  addresses formed: 15 against 1,024   (68 to 1)
  addresses discarded: 0 against 1,009

  The two columns are compared only where the unit is common:
  symbols held, and addresses formed.  Structural acts and
  elementary operations are reported in their own measures and
  are never divided into one another (conventions.py).

